  "articleBodyHtml": "<h2>Reducing Nervousness Before a Presentation</h2>\n<p>The speaker suggests that rubbing someone&#x27;s back and giving them a big whack can help reduce nervousness before a big presentation. This method is described as effective, with the speaker stating, &#x27;It works well, ok.&#x27;</p>\n<h2>Encouraging Audience Participation</h2>\n<p>The speaker encourages the audience to submit questions and petal sightings with the hashtag FWMCMorning. They express gratitude for previous submissions and emphasize the importance of continued participation from the audience.</p>\n<h2>Announcing the Next Stream</h2>\n<p>The speaker announces their next stream as &#x27;The Den&#x27; and asks the audience for strategies to help them in the game. They invite the audience to share any useful tips or advice for the upcoming game session.</p>\n<h2>Game Details and Player Participation</h2>\n<p>The speaker reveals that the game is Super Smash Bros Ultimate instead of Brawl and asks if both players are going to play. This change in the game title is presented as a surprise to the audience.</p>\n<h2>Game Strategy and Challenges</h2>\n<p>The speaker mentions that both players are going to play and plans to hit lots of buttons, while acknowledging that not falling off is difficult. This highlights the challenges they expect to face during the game.</p>\n<h2>Character Description and Intentions</h2>\n<p>They want to be mean to her, but she is like a super nice senpai. This statement reflects the speaker&#x27;s playful and somewhat teasing attitude towards the senpai character.</p>\n<h2>Intentions to Cause Mild Discomfort</h2>\n<p>They want to make her feel pain at work, at least a little bit. This statement suggests a lighthearted and humorous approach to the situation, focusing on causing minimal discomfort.</p>\n<h2>Experience and Skill Assessment</h2>\n<p>They mentioned that she is not very experienced at it, and they think it&#x27;s not them who is better at Smash. This highlights the speaker&#x27;s awareness of the skill level of the other player and their own uncertainty about their abilities.</p>\n<h2>Nervousness and Exploration</h2>\n<p>They are a bit nervous and paused for various reasons, but they are going to check the back rooms of Fubuki-senpai. This statement reflects the speaker&#x27;s nervousness and the plan to explore further in the game.</p>\n<h2>Game Plan and Expectations</h2>\n<p>They hope to find Pero, will have fun playing Ocarina of Time, and will be walking out after that. This outlines the speaker&#x27;s expectations and plans for the upcoming game session.</p>\n<h2>Theme and Time Travel</h2>\n<p>They mentioned that the theme has been decided, and they might not need a time machine to feel like they&#x27;ve gone back in time. This suggests that the theme is nostalgic or reminiscent of the past.</p>\n<h2>Closing Remarks and Shoutouts</h2>\n<p>They thanked the Ruffians for joining, mentioned a shoutout to fans, and concluded with Fumiko Mining. This serves as a closing statement, expressing gratitude and acknowledging the audience&#x27;s support.</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_aK_6Wb05hY</p>",
