      "timestampSeconds": 1542,
      "text": "Yeah!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1543,
      "text": "Bye-bye!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1544,
      "text": "Bye-bye!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1545,
      "text": "And today, do we have a question?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1546,
      "text": "Question of the day is..."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1547,
      "text": "I was wondering if you have any specific rituals or practices that you do to relax when you're"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1548,
      "text": "nervous before doing something big like an interview or presentation?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1549,
      "text": "Good question."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1550,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1551,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1552,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1573,
      "text": "I think you know, after all that guard dog training, we don't really get that nervous"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1577,
      "text": "anymore!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1579,
      "text": "But when we're feeling a little bit anxious about something, we like to go on a good walk"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1584,
      "text": "beforehand!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1586,
      "text": "Yeah a walk is always good, it brings good energy, good luck, we don't calm down!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1592,
      "text": "Because everything's here, you know, it helps a lot!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1595,
      "text": "Ahh, but we also like stretching or other exercise too but if you really just don't have"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1600,
      "text": "And for that, we have another secret"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1669,
      "text": "If you ever feel nervous before a big presentation"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1673,
      "text": "You just need to find somebody to rub your back"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1676,
      "text": "And then give it a big whack"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1678,
      "text": "As hard as you can"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1680,
      "text": "It works well, ok"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1685,
      "text": "Thank you so much, Ruffians, for your submissions always"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1688,
      "text": "As you know, we're still looking for more petal sightings"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 1691,
      "text": "Doggy of the day questions"
    },
    {
